51⟩\n  * ...⟨52⟩\n  * 25⟨53⟩\n  * Next ⟨50⟩\n\n\n!! We are not related to the Roblox company, this is a community dataset called RobloxAgent due to it being related to the Roblox studio environment.\n#   ⟨54⟩ RobloxAgent tool reason v2 dataset \nVersion 2 of RobloxAgent, an agentic dataset designed to train generalists LLM's alike to work better with the Roblox Studio Luau environment (and generate better luau code). All data was generated in a real, live, working Roblox studio place, you could also use this dataset to see how the AI agents dealt with the studio. Most prompts were generated by qwen3 next 80b a3b instruct and gemma4 26b a4b diffusion. most outputs were by Ring 2.6 1T⟨55⟩. Total dataset cost: ~400$.\nIf there are issues please say so in the community tab. Of course if you liked the work, consider liking the dataset and if you used the dataset, please consider stating so in your README. Thank you, enjoy 💕\nCopy to bucket new\nUse this dataset \n\nDownloads last month\n    88\nNumber of rows: 2,441 Total file size: 1.19 GB\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨56⟩ Privacy⟨57⟩ About⟨58⟩ Careers⟨59⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\n",
